        <activityName xml:lang="en">Kitchen cupboard, front profile paint, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Kitchen cupboard, front profile paint, at plant
na;
UUID: 45819681-a83b-300f-bafa-5dee43efcf08
This data set includes the basic structure of the kitchen cupboards (melamin coated particle board) and the front cover (painted) per m3. The inventory bases on a kitchen with a cupboard volume of 3.36  m3. Screws and hinges are considered proportionally. The countertop, sink, waste system and cooker hood are not included.; Geography: Data valid for Switzerland
Location: Data valid for Switzerland
Technology: Average production
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_45819681-a83b-300f-bafa-5dee43efcf08.xml</text>
